## 🚨 CRITICAL VULNERABILITIES & ISSUES FOUND

### 1. **Missing HTTPS/TLS Support**
**Severity:** CRITICAL
**Category:** Transport Layer Security

**Issue:**
The application listens only on HTTP (port 3000) with no HTTPS support. This exposes all data transmission to man-in-the-middle (MITM) attacks.

**Current Code:**
```javascript
