## 🔧 Implementation: AWS Secrets Manager

### Step 1: Create Secrets in AWS
```bash
# Store secrets (one-time setup)
aws secretsmanager create-secret \
  --name app/production/secrets \
  --secret-string '{"ACCESS_TOKEN_SECRET":"<generated-value>","REFRESH_TOKEN_SECRET":"<generated-value>"}'

