## 10. COMPLIANCE & STANDARDS

### 10.1 OWASP Top 10 2021 Coverage

- ✅ A01: Broken Access Control → Authorization checks
- ✅ A02: Cryptographic Failures → HTTPS, Password hashing
- ✅ A03: Injection → Parameterized queries, Input validation
- ✅ A04: Insecure Design → Secure-by-design principles
- ✅ A05: Security Misconfiguration → Helmet, Secure headers
- ✅ A06: Vulnerable Components → Dependency audits
- ✅ A07: Authentication Failures → JWT, Password hashing
- ✅ A08: Data Integrity Failures → HTTPS, Signatures
- ✅ A09: Logging & Monitoring → Winston logger
- ✅ A10: SSRF → Input validation

### 10.2 Other Compliance

```javascript
