## 8. INSECURE DESERIALIZATION

### ❌ VULNERABLE CODE
```javascript
const pickle = require('pickle'); // Unsafe deserialization

app.post('/data', (req, res) => {
  // Deserializing untrusted data - Code Execution!
  const obj = pickle.loads(req.body.data);
  res.json(obj);
});
```

### ✓ SECURE CODE
```javascript
app.post('/data', express.json(), (req, res) => {
  // JSON parse is safe (no code execution)
  // JSON already parsed by express.json() middleware
  const obj = req.body;

  // Validate structure
  if (!obj.field1 || typeof obj.field1 !== 'string') {
    return res.status(400).json({ error: 'Invalid data' });
  }

  res.json(obj);
});
```

