## 🛡️ Additional Security Practices

### 1. Secret Rotation Without Downtime

```javascript
// Maintain old + new secret during rotation
const JWT_SECRETS = {
  current: secrets.jwt_secret_v2,
  previous: secrets.jwt_secret_v1
};

jwt.verify(token, JWT_SECRETS.current, (err, user) => {
  if (err && JWT_SECRETS.previous) {
    // Try with previous secret
    jwt.verify(token, JWT_SECRETS.previous, (err, user) => {
      if (err) return res.status(403).json({ error: 'Invalid token' });
      req.user = user;
      next();
    });
  } else if (err) {
    return res.status(403).json({ error: 'Invalid token' });
  } else {
    req.user = user;
    next();
  }
});
```

### 2. Secret Audit Logging

