PHASE 5: DATA FILTERING & PRIVACY (1 hour)
============================================================================

STEP 5.1: Create data sanitization function
```javascript
const sanitizeUser = (user, currentUser) => {
  const sanitized = {
    id: user.id,
    name: user.name,
  };

  // Only return email if authorized
  if (currentUser && 
      (currentUser.id === user.id || currentUser.role === 'admin')) {
    sanitized.email = user.email;
  }

  return sanitized;
};
```

STEP 5.2: Apply sanitization to responses
BEFORE:
```javascript
app.get('/users', authenticateToken, (req, res) => {
  res.json([
    { id: 1, name: 'Alice', email: 'alice@example.com' },
  ]);
});
```

AFTER:
```javascript
app.get('/users', authenticateToken, (req, res) => {
  const users = [...];
  const sanitized = users.map(u => sanitizeUser(u, req.user));
  res.json(sanitized);
});
```

STEP 5.3: Never log sensitive data
